Homepage: https://www.infopanel.net
Description: sensor dashboards for USB panels, designed in the browser
 InfoPanel reads the computer's sensors (hwmon and thermal zones, CPU,
 memory, disks, AMD and NVIDIA GPUs) and draws them on small USB panels.
 Its editor runs in the browser; the engine serves it on this computer only.
